WEBVTT

00:14:29.018 --> 00:14:31.064
I've been all around the world,

00:14:31.088 --> 00:14:33.708
and there will be a thousand kids
crying out your name,

00:14:33.732 --> 00:14:35.780
and it's such a weird,
visceral experience.

00:14:35.804 --> 00:14:37.411
It's like, it's disorienting.

00:14:37.435 --> 00:14:39.513
And you get in a car, and you drive away,

00:14:39.537 --> 00:14:42.407
and 10-minute drive, and you get out,

00:14:42.431 --> 00:14:44.242
and no one gives a rat's who you are.

00:14:44.266 --> 00:14:45.632
(Laughter)

00:14:45.656 --> 00:14:48.937
And it gives you that clarity
of perspective of, man, I'm just me,

00:14:48.961 --> 00:14:51.671
and popularity, what does that
really mean again?

00:14:51.695 --> 00:14:53.116
Not much.

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:55.299
It's peer respect that drives us.

00:14:55.323 --> 00:14:57.644
That's the one thing
that makes us do what we do.

00:14:57.668 --> 00:15:01.749
I've had over a dozen bones,
this guy, over, eight, 10 concussions,